          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Must Attach to" typeId="2c63-5e3f-9132-459d">This unit must attach to either of the following units, even if there is another leader attached to it:
a) CADIAN PLATOON COMMANDER
b) DEATH KORPS PLATOON COMMANDER
c) MORDIAN PLATOON COMMANDER
This unit does not count towards the leader maximum of the army list.
Only one MASTER OF ORDNANCE unit may attach to any one unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Artillery Expert" id="f2f6-2d69-eba5-49d7" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">While this unit has a MASTER OF ORDNANCE model, this unit gains:

Range Finders: While enemy units are visible to this unit, each time you roll 2D6 for Barrage for that unit, you may roll an additional D6 and discard the lowest.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
