        <profile name="Summary Execution" id="8197-c744-f01b-ab33" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After this unit&apos;s Move step, you may select one of your infantry units within 8&quot; of and visible to this unit with Suppressed X. Then, one model from that unit dies. Then, roll 2D3 and reduce its Suppressed X by the result.</characteristic>
