        <profile name="Drilled Fire" id="e27f-b6b9-70ac-33e1" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">While each of this unit&apos;s models are touching another model in this unit, for each ranged attack made by another friendly Imperial Guard unit that targets an enemy unit within 24&quot; of this unit, reroll a Hit Roll of 1 for that attack.</characteristic>
